Loom: the physical issuer orders sticky status writes (OR-accumulating flags such as srFPFlags) like ordinary
writes, though the schedule graph already treats them as commutative; a softmax MAC waited 4 cycles on an earlier FP op's flag
write. GPU sets byte-identical; changes the NPU split's 27 images (NPU gate: pp2048 window 00 bit-identical);
NPU attention one core 680.4 -> 672.4 cycles a body, O exact.
diff --git a/loom/src/loom/codegen/low/schedule/physical_issue.c b/loom/src/loom/codegen/low/schedule/physical_issue.c
index b3d0e91116..c08f4b13fb 100644
